WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.350
A heavy wheel sits at rest on its axle.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.710
A motor starts to twist it.

3
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.740
Gently at first, then
harder, and harder still.

4
00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:14.760
The familiar spinning equations only hold
when the spin builds at a steady rate.

5
00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:16.620
Here, it doesn't.

6
00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:20.520
So how do you work out how fast
the wheel ends up spinning?

7
00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:24.520
In this mission, you'll follow
a turntable instant by instant,

8
00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.380
reading its spin from
the slope of a graph.

9
00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:31.520
Then you'll use your right hand
to find which way a twist points.

10
00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:36.160
Your mission: work out how fast the wheel
ends up spinning when its twist keeps

11
00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:36.910
growing.
